.operator-license-key
.operator-license-key.pub
*-license-key

# Beta build key — generated at build time, NEVER committed (this repo is public)
electron/embedded-key.js

# Internal operational reports — this repo is PUBLIC.
# These are night-shift memos and ops ledgers written for Cole, not product docs.
# They carry unit economics, unremediated-defect narratives, single-point-of-failure
# maps, third-party contacts and personal career intent. They stay on disk; they
# never become world-readable under the organisation's own account.
store/overnight-report-*.md
store/release-ledger.md
store/external-artifacts.md
store/console-action-packet.md
store/topup-refund-remediation.md
store/morning-report-*.md

# Console completion packets: sensitive working docs, live in the vault; present locally for the release gate, never committed (public repo)
store/apple-console-completion-packet.md
store/google-console-completion-packet.md
